    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:47351cb592597a3f229e2e41",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "有马纪念结束后・最棒的好孩子摸摸头",
      "source_fingerprint": "17ee4c1611ebfaf1c0ec2eedccf1c63816cc6e15db72920a6c6aab96df055434",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1045/storytimeline_501045314.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f1c2ce7c04c34b662cb806ab",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我与超级溪流一起展开\n以闪耀系列赛为目标的日子。",
      "source_fingerprint": "55a225d233f84c40c7869b5abee10c42eb9c0707de251546c37b8f1f1e8440e2",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1045/storytimeline_501045400.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d5c14e7a6921088a9ba4a709",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "想要尽情溺爱训练员、\n让训练员拿下各项头衔的她，\n内心激动不已。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e07e3a01e5ba83ac8f8caea8520afc5fd384a22cc65463ba2bfe33d117381b60",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1045/storytimeline_501045400.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f095561e872c709146016267",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "训练员也誓言要提高自己的能力，\n好成为她的助力。",
      "source_fingerprint": "11ee2ac11f5bda95b3fb0feb7617ba625e019014b95d961015b7b816aec6e248",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1045/storytimeline_501045400.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ee5c59687ba958a4de16e8da",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "超级溪流登场！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7d4e8f210de944df90c88e18615bd5281a8aad71397f7eb86a8b667a424c4c6e",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1045/storytimeline_501045400.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:44497b9645708e7ad24f1d73",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "超级溪流为了“堇S”不断努力训练。",
      "source_fingerprint": "fd1b68d43023cc2414894591a05dfdab423224a2ce2be26585a5965c0a2ac758",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1045/storytimeline_501045401.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b4191d6b892eea4f1e18bc27",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "为了让训练员露出笑容，\n她发誓要在经典路线的三场比赛中获胜。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b18ea638aa373a097352ff29555f1114051a436ece6774220ea86bc26d8931c6",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1045/storytimeline_501045401.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:296abbf1691d67cbfb1e91b7",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "……为此，她暗中持续努力着，\n好让自己的实力更上一层楼。",
      "source_fingerprint": "03c8afb180852cb9cd3f7e0476a75888c4811958d1846fa6331db807cffdafb7",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1045/storytimeline_501045401.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:71ab491ff8cd5b35668db80c",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "想要多少呢？",
      "source_fingerprint": "5a675e1a912781cfd473cbc4b40ae80339e4e35b88de3ff84a2a9e20c2d8affa",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1045/storytimeline_501045401.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:12355e67955c6a3518e1c3db",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "超级溪流的状态持续低落，\n一般大众对此议论纷纷，\n还说是训练员导致她无法出赛。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5a647d0aff4edcc291aa307db4ff00269429353fe7f03bf7b971ca20fac93bdd",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1045/storytimeline_501045402.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:299bdbb5ac4847b05b32580b",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "超级溪流表示不满，\n为了否定这个说法进行训练，\n却使得身体状况变差了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "cbe243d01bf539e49a68ec0d6bed8b8a29c73c9121b2907988690850b9104884",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1045/storytimeline_501045402.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f2f5a0d01238ecd93b53008f",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "看到她的情况，\n训练员发现她之所以陷入低潮，\n就是因为她“为了别人”而努力过度。",
      "source_fingerprint": "66c6ab71b09299f32a56b2f61bab7e962b4caf517eeae83f1fe194cf2ff56886",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1045/storytimeline_501045402.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6aff80618fbbaa2ef18546ff",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "没有成果的春天",
      "source_fingerprint": "9fba31910c52f9114d8d841ed07303f3868a9dc4af019fac5863945838f20227",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1045/storytimeline_501045402.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9109d2833ffe5b29a52933b9",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "“天皇赏（春）”结束后的某天。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5738cdf08061d05556534519127937efc0c826c35f03aa1ae4faa0823c1de869",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1045/storytimeline_501045403.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b72dc4b1204a3f9953e75b67",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "玉藻十字感到很后悔，\n因为自己的失言让超级溪流认真起来。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7efb0fadb38020eebe879c2299c8cab153056bfbf44286c7484ecd866dda6590",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1045/storytimeline_501045403.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:99da5123d6eb987885f5db52",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "听了她的说明，训练员终于知道\n是因为玉藻十字想要伤害他，\n超级溪流才会拿出真本事。",
      "source_fingerprint": "fe94848d74e345c725abb48e7e20d678f8d70188fd96abb415f8290a852120a1",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1045/storytimeline_501045403.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6e0ce9c89906dc967b2e5368",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "因此训练员在内心祈求\n超级溪流在下场比赛能心平气和地参赛。",
      "source_fingerprint": "38dc2e47fdf5a86caa1a51a755e5b647642f42403e94f229806c6565940fec3a",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1045/storytimeline_501045403.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        3,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/3/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3a550ccba846060b855be1cb",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "拿出真本事的原因",
      "source_fingerprint": "99043fe1e6a522d34e680e70e8823e2285bdbf8326b4045a91e395042e93de7e",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
